sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Authenticated IT user
    actor Supervisor as CIO or Manage Todos supervisor
    participant Support as Troubleshooting
    participant Monitor as Zendesk Monitor
    participant API as Insights API
    participant Fred
    participant Zendesk

    User->>Support: Open /support
    Support->>API: GET /api/zendesk/controls
    alt Current saved state loads
        API-->>Support: Flags, canManage, actor, timestamp
    else State unavailable
        API-->>Support: HTTP 503 read failure
        Support-->>User: Status unknown, controls and actions disabled
        User->>Support: Retry controls
    end

    opt Authorized global control change
        Supervisor->>Support: Confirm one switch change
        Support->>API: PUT one boolean control
        API->>API: Authorize, validate, and persist
        API-->>Support: Current state, actor, timestamp
    end

    User->>Monitor: Open Monitor
    loop Queue 15 seconds, selected thread 5 seconds
        Monitor->>API: Read queue, drafts, and selected ticket
        API->>Zendesk: Read ticket and Conversation Log
        Zendesk-->>API: Current user, agent, and bot messages
        API-->>Monitor: Queue, thread, and saved control state
    end

    User->>Monitor: Request one or batch Fred draft
    Monitor->>API: Prepare and save Fred draft
    API->>API: Enforce current Fred control
    alt Fred is OFF or control state is unavailable
        API-->>Monitor: Draft blocked, no Zendesk write
    else Fred is ON
        API->>Fred: Observation-only request with ticket evidence
        Fred-->>API: Draft body only
        API-->>Monitor: Shared pending draft and audit metadata
    end

    User->>Monitor: Edit and confirm exact saved draft
    alt Zendesk Messaging ticket
        Monitor->>API: Recheck current reply control immediately before handoff
        alt Replies are OFF or state is unavailable
            API-->>Monitor: Handoff blocked, nothing copied or opened
        else Replies are ON
            API-->>Monitor: Current permission confirmed
            Monitor-->>User: Copy draft and open Agent Workspace
            User->>Zendesk: Review and send in Messaging composer
        end
    else Zendesk Support ticket
        Monitor->>API: Approve with confirmed flag and current draft token
        API->>API: Reject stale draft and atomically claim send
        alt Replies are OFF or state is unavailable
            API-->>Monitor: Send blocked, draft remains pending
        else Replies are ON
            API->>Zendesk: Add confirmed public reply
            Zendesk-->>API: Reply accepted
            API-->>Monitor: Sent status, actor, timestamp
        end
    end

    opt Confirmed human escalation
        User->>Monitor: Choose teammate and optional private note
        Monitor->>API: Submit confirmed handoff
        API->>Zendesk: Reassign ticket and add internal note
        Zendesk-->>Monitor: Updated owner and conversation
    end

    Note over API,Zendesk: Escalation remains available while Fred or public replies are paused.
